GAIDEN: Ragebound</i> pays homage to the past while pushing the boundaries of modern pixel art, making every battle a feast for the eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542120/extras/Kenji_kumori_merged_gameplay_1.gif?t=1751027815\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to become a true ninja master?</strong></p>","developers":["The Game Kitchen"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542120/5542b8dc4596b8efd39dd68ce092855922f8b88f/header.jpg?t=1751027815","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD. All rights reserved. Developed by The Game Kitchen, published by Dotemu SAS","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257143560,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143560/movie480.mp4?t=1749489314","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143560/movie_max.mp4?t=1749489314"},"name":"Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143560/9ffcaefd510319f76e4bf4d16158d8ff34850990/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749489314","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143560/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749489314","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143560/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749489314"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257126682,"mp4":{"480":"ht